{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_045030","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Bigfoot是一种栖息在落基山脉的猿人。在当地原住民的语言里，也叫Sasquatch。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"身高居然超过<R=3瓦拉,2.5m>！厉害吧！","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=3瓦拉,2.5m>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"跟大猩猩不一样吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"完全不一样！大猩猩再大也就<R=2瓦拉,约1.6m>多一点，而且是把拳头撑在地上走的。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=2瓦拉,约1.6m>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"Bigfoot更大，而且和人类一样用两条腿走路。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"也就是说，比起猿，它更接近人类。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"大概是在进化过程中的某个阶段，从人类这一支分化出去的吧。那时人类甚至还没开始使用工具。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"但就算都是山地，落基山脉离这里也很远吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不算远。按达尔文的理论，人类不也从非洲千里迢迢来到这里了吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"而且，委内瑞拉也有人目击过一种叫Monos的猿人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加的生物种类那么丰富，就算有猿人也不奇怪。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"“猿人而已”吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""}]}